WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.277
Words can name precise school topics; compound words combine meaningful word parts.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.426
What is a compound word? Answer: Two smaller words joined into one.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:15.465
Keep a vocabulary notebook and explain the two parts of three compounds.

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:19.697
Discuss why: Compound words combine meaningful parts.
